  <spirit:description>EES-338 (xc7a35t) SoC: 5-stage pipelined RV32I CPU (hardwired control, forwarding/stall/flush, overflow detect) + memory-mapped peripherals: USB-UART, BLE-CC41-A bluetooth and JLX128128G ST7571 LCD. MMIO: 0x1000_0000 UART_DATA/0x1000_0004 UART_STATUS, 0x1000_0010 BT_DATA/0x1000_0014 BT_STATUS, 0x1000_0100 LCD_CMD/0x1000_0104 LCD_DAT/0x1000_0108 LCD_STATUS/0x1000_010C LCD_CTRL. Clock: single 50 MHz logic clock (use clk_wiz from the 100 MHz board clock).</spirit:description>
